    description: "Phase 4b of ADR-0027. Remove deprecated values (endpoint_shape axis with completed Phase 3 cluster migration) from packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/symbol_kinds.py::SYMBOL_KINDS. Schema enum values disappear for removed entries. Drift property test treats any remaining consumer-side reference as a regression. Second SCHEMA_VERSION minor bump.\n\nThis item ships piecewise per-cluster as each Phase 3 cluster's awaits_bakeoff_validation tag clears, mirroring ADR-0023 Phase 4b's piecewise pattern. Do NOT remove all endpoint_shape values in one PR — that would break cross-validation against the corresponding Phase 3 producer migration's bakeoff window.\n\nMirrors ADR-0023's Phase 4b hard-fail shape.\n\nReference: docs/adr/0027-symbol-kind-language-construct-only.md §\"Phase 4 — schema bump and deprecation removal\"."  # 57a9
